<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: adult chaos slime -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.label>成年混沌史莱姆</OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.label>
  <!-- EN: Slimes - an amalgam life-form that was developed as an alternative source of necessary materials for Obsidia Expansion.\n\nChaos slime - under the influence of an unknown force from the outside, they began to fuse their bodies into something single.\n\nAdult chaos slimes is the second stage in the chaos slimes fusion chain which yields a much larger, stronger and more resilient foe. -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.description>史莱姆 - 一种融合生命体，被开发作为黑曜石扩展所需材料的替代来源。\n\n混沌史莱姆 - 在外界未知力量的影响下，它们开始将身体融合成单一的实体。\n\n成年混沌史莱姆是混沌史莱姆融合链中的第二阶段，产生更大、更强、更具韧性的敌人。</OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: mouth -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.tools.mouth.label>口</OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.tools.mouth.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.tools.head.label>头部</OE_ChaosSlime_Adult.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Badass chaos slime -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.label>强大的混沌史莱姆</OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.label>
  <!-- EN: Slimes - an amalgam life-form that was developed as an alternative source of necessary materials for Obsidia Expansion.\n\nChaos slime - under the influence of an unknown force from the outside, they began to fuse their bodies into something single.\n\nBadass chaos slimes is the third stage in the chaos slimes fusion chain which yields a much larger, stronger and more resilient foe. -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.description>史莱姆 - 一种融合生命体，被开发作为黑曜石扩展所需材料的替代来源。\n\n混沌史莱姆 - 在外界未知力量的影响下，它们开始将身体融合成单一的实体。\n\n强大的混沌史莱姆是混沌史莱姆融合链中的第三阶段，产生更大、更强、更具韧性的敌人。</OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: mouth -->
  <OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.tools.mouth.label>口</OE_ChaosSlime_Badass.tools.mouth.label>
